# Base URL of the leaderboard API, INCLUDING the /api segment — the client
# appends /leaderboard and /leaderboard/progress to whatever you put here, and
# the routes live at /api/leaderboard/*. Point it at a bare origin and every
# upload 404s silently (submitPass swallows failures by design) while the board
# shows only a generic error.
#
# Leave it UNSET to disable the leaderboard entirely: with no value the client
# makes no network calls at all, which is what keeps this feature inert on a
# deployment that has not been configured for it.
VITE_LEADERBOARD_API=https://your-backend-project.vercel.app/api
